# Cube.js

## Layout

- Config: `cube/cube.js`
- Models: `cube/model/cubes/*.yml` — **not** `schema/` (Cube 1.6+ default is `model/`)

## Tenant isolation

`queryRewrite` injects `Orders.tenantId` filter from JWT `tenantId`.

## Widget queries

Built in `packages/core/src/build-widget-query.ts`:
- `timeDimensions` when widget has `timeDimension` + `dateRange`
- `filters` from widget editor
- KPI: measures only; charts: need dimensions

## Demo data

Seeded per org via `seed-demo-orders.ts` on cube token / insights generate.
